{"groups":[{"id":"ma","title":"-ma 結尾，卻是陽性","rule":"來自希臘文的 -ma 結尾名詞，多半是陽性：el problema、el tema、el sistema（不是 la）。","src":"ai"},{"id":"a-m","title":"其他 -a 結尾的陽性","rule":"少數 -a 結尾的名詞是陽性，要直接記：el día、el mapa、el planeta。","src":"ai"},{"id":"o-f","title":"-o 結尾，卻是陰性","rule":"la mano 是 -o 結尾的陰性字；la foto、la moto 是 fotografía、motocicleta 的縮寫，所以也是陰性。","src":"ai"},{"id":"el-f","title":"陰性，但單數用 el","rule":"字首是重讀的 a（或 ha）時，單數前面改用 el：el agua。字還是陰性：複數回到 las（las aguas），形容詞也用陰性（el agua fría）。","src":"ai"},{"id":"e","title":"-e 結尾：沒有規則","rule":"-e 結尾的名詞，陽性、陰性都有，沒有規則，要連冠詞一起背：la noche、la leche；el coche、el nombre。","src":"ai"},{"id":"cons","title":"子音結尾：要死記","rule":"子音結尾的名詞同樣沒有可靠的規則，連冠詞一起背：la luz、la flor；el lápiz、el árbol。","src":"ai"},{"id":"rule","title":"有規則可循","rule":"-ción、-sión、-dad、-tad、-tud、-umbre 結尾是陰性（la canción、la ciudad、la costumbre）；-aje 結尾是陽性（el viaje）。-ión 但不是 -ción 的字要個別記：多半也是陰性（la región、la opinión），但 el avión、el camión 是陽性。","src":"ai"}],"words":[{"id":"g-problema","es":"problema","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"問題（陽性，雖然以 a 結尾）","src":"ai","vocabId":"v-problema"},{"id":"g-tema","es":"tema","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"主題","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-sistema","es":"sistema","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"系統、制度（陽性，雖然以 a 結尾）","src":"ai","vocabId":"v-sistema"},{"id":"g-idioma","es":"idioma","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"語言","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-programa","es":"programa","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"節目；程式","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-clima","es":"clima","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"氣候","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-drama","es":"drama","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"戲劇、悲劇（陽性，雖然詞尾是 a）","src":"ai","vocabId":"v-drama"},{"id":"g-poema","es":"poema","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"詩","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-diploma","es":"diploma","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"文憑；畢業證書","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-esquema","es":"esquema","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"大綱；示意圖","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-síntoma","es":"síntoma","gender":"m","group":"ma","zh":"症狀","src":"ai"},{"id":"g-panorama","es":"panorama","gender":"m",